<title>PORTUGAL: Price eases at Portugal 7-yr floater auction.</title>
<headline>Price eases at Portugal 7-yr floater auction.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average price fell to 99.8367 from 99.8930 at the state auction of 15 billion escudos of</p>
<p>variable-rate, seven-year bonds (OTRV), the Institute of Public</p>
<p>Credit Management said.</p>
<p>    ISSUER: Republic of Portugal   MATURITY: 15/8/03</p>
<p>    AMMOUNT:15 bl esc	 INDEX: Six-month Lisbor less 25 bps</p>
<p>    PAYMENT DATE :16/1/96   PAYMENT FREQUENCY: Six-monthly</p>
<p>    AVGE PRICE:99.8367	MAX:99.86	MIN:99.80</p>
<p>    DEMAND:66 billion	 S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>Note - The issue is fungible. The total outstanding amount is 238.89 billion escudos.</p>
</text>
